1. Renamed the corrupt `index` to `index.corrupt.bak` under
   `C:\Users\khamis\Desktop\manus-local\.git\worktrees\devin-d19\` and rebuilt it with
   `git read-tree HEAD`; `git merge --abort` then succeeded.
